  ;; ============================================================
  ;; TEXT ANNOTATIONS
  ;; ============================================================
  (text "WIRELESS COMMUNICATIONS (Rev 1.2 - Full Industrial Grade)\n\n1. LoRa (SX1276IMLTRT - Bare IC):\n   - SPI1 interface, 868/915MHz\n   - +20dBm TX, -148dBm sensitivity\n   - SMA antenna connector + pi-matching network\n   - INDUSTRIAL TEMP: -40 to +85C (bare IC, not module)\n   - QFN-28 package, custom RF section with matching\n   - 32MHz TCXO for frequency stability\n\n2. WiFi (ATWINC1500-MR210PB):\n   - SPI2 interface, 802.11 b/g/n\n   - Built-in TCP/IP + TLS 1.2 stack\n   - u.FL antenna connector\n   - Industrial temp: -40 to +85C\n   - No second MCU required (SPI slave)\n\n3. BLE (RN4870-I/RM128):\n   - UART7 interface, ASCII command set\n   - BLE 5.0, built-in antenna\n   - Industrial temp: -40 to +85C\n   - Microchip ecosystem\n\n4. GSM/LTE (SIM7600G-H):\n   - UART4 interface, AT commands\n   - LTE Cat-1 global + 2G/3G fallback\n   - Nano SIM push-push holder\n   - SMA connectors (Main + GNSS)\n   - Dedicated 4.1V LDO, 100uF bulk caps\n\n5. Hardware Watchdog (TPS3823-33):\n   - External WDT, 1.6s timeout\n   - Monitors 3.3V supply voltage\n   - Active-low RESET output to STM32 NRST"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 152.4 160.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "WL-TEXT-0001")
  )
